# Filters for a mutants-check-* run (one cargo-mutants argument per line).
# check-3 (2026-10-20): the functions the 2026-10-20 tests target (missed in mutants-check-2).
-f protection-pool/src/backer.rs
-f protection-pool/src/settings.rs
-f protection-pool/src/stake.rs
-F 'in (limits|complete_withdrawal|collectable_view|claim_yield|consistent_with_live|withdraw)$'
